    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"MongoTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionManager</code></a> obtaining sessions from the given <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>\napplying the given <code>options</code>, if present, when starting a new transaction.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"MongoTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionManager</code></a>，从给定的<a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>获取会话，并在启动新事务时应用给定的<code>options</code>（如果存在）。",
