      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"MongoTransactionManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionManager</code></a>，从给定的<a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a>获取会话。",
